SCOPE

"The Work" means everything contained in this repository, including but not
limited to:

  (a) the source code of the frontend and backend applications;
  (b) the quiz questions, their wording, ordering, and answer scales, in every
      language in which they appear;
  (c) the ideology, country, and personality profiles, including their names,
      descriptions, categories, and editorial text;
  (d) the twelve-axis model, the axis definitions, and the numeric vectors
      assigned to any profile;
  (e) the matching and scoring algorithms and their calibration data; and
  (f) the visual design, imagery, and accompanying documentation.

